{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1518407,\"title\":\"Violet\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"An advanced AI with evolving emotions reveals a journalist's dark secrets during a high-profile demonstration, changing their lives forever.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/egglPD6OdiZfZw5OW4s7L9PyrxC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2025,\"runtime\":80,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Dexter Hudgens\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5584090,\"name\":\"Dexter Hudgens\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":21315,\"name\":\"Eric Roberts\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/NiWg1TaUcal7xn1ZQeyA2dLd5F.jpg\"},{\"id\":1479883,\"name\":\"Bourke Floyd\",\"character\":\"Buddy (FBI Agent)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x1IWBk0mprpBuCYtVFtGoifEME6.jpg\"},{\"id\":4773427,\"name\":\"Maximilian Seed\",\"character\":\"Carlos\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5051410,\"name\":\"Jay Kiman\",\"character\":\"Michael Nighy\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2158280,\"name\":\"Tyshon Freeman\",\"character\":\"Jason War\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Qz9aFbxZ6WdPSEDYyOl3qmtKYj.jpg\"},{\"id\":5305259,\"name\":\"Del Harrison\",\"character\":\"Violet (Omega)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":755898,\"title\":\"War of the Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvirUYrva23IudARHn3mMGVxWqM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iZLqwEwUViJdSkGVjePGhxYzbDb.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Will Radford is a top analyst for Homeland Security who tracks potential threats through a mass surveillance program, until one day an attack by an unknown entity leads him to question whether the government is hiding something from him... and from the rest of the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1384216,\"title\":\"The Dog Stars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5O616X9vmRzQdB68PHzBewPittd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3k7GzxOdLZkN3eZsuhLi2eRzkXO.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the world's population has been ravaged by a pandemic, a man lives a lonesome existence in a Colorado airplane hangar with his dog and a dour gunman he has befriended. When a mysterious transmission comes through on the radio while he’s flying his old Cessna, it sparks a hunt for the provenance of the sound.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":131631,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Mockingjay - Part 1\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4FAA18ZIja70d1Tu5hr5cj2q1sB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lV1P1Q5gLDXVG1ZYCxZHStkcQC3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After surviving the Quarter Quell, Katniss finds herself in the hidden stronghold of District 13, where the rebellion against the Capitol is gaining momentum. Struggling with the weight of becoming the symbol of resistance, she must navigate fragile alliances while trying to protect those she loves. As propaganda battles rage and Panem moves closer to full-scale war, Katniss is forced to confront the true cost of revolution.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1275779,\"title\":\"Disclosure Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AnJ8IQJI23hNpYXVNaythu061Ru.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1e0KDRYKRPHiVNj8yQKYuU2jVyQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A cybersecurity expert becomes a whistleblower after uncovering secrets about aliens, putting him on the run from a corporation. Meanwhile, a meteorologist experiencing strange phenomena joins forces with him to prove there's life beyond our understanding.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1265609,\"title\":\"War Machine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198663,\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\